      "text": "Locking down 31,000 miles of maritime border. \n\nEnsuring robust, layered security is what our crews train for. Through relentless vigilance, a boarding team from @USCG Cutter Haddock safely interdicted a suspicious vessel and 10 suspected aliens off San Clemente Island, transferring them to U.S. Border Patrol. \n\nA vigilant Coast Guard means a safer nation. \n\nRead more: https://t.co/dLPaNabLGX",
      "text_resolved": "Locking down 31,000 miles of maritime border. \n\nEnsuring robust, layered security is what our crews train for. Through relentless vigilance, a boarding team from @USCG Cutter Haddock safely interdicted a suspicious vessel and 10 suspected aliens off San Clemente Island, transferring them to U.S. Border Patrol. \n\nA vigilant Coast Guard means a safer nation. \n\nRead more: https://www.news.uscg.mil/Press-Releases/Article/4499971/coast-guard-interdicts-10-aliens-near-san-clemente-island/",
